flowchart LR
    subgraph CLIENTS[Telemedicine portals]
      P[Patient app]
      D[Doctor portal]
      N[Nurse portal]
      PH[Pharmacy portal]
    end
    P --> API[Telemedicine API]
    D --> API
    N --> API
    PH --> API
    API -->|authoritative writes and read-after-write| PG[(PostgreSQL primary)]
    PG -->|streaming replication| ST[(Standby for fenced failover)]
    PG -->|asynchronous read-only replication| RR[(Search and reporting replica)]
    API -->|history projection through outbox consumer| MG[(MongoDB replica set)]
    API --> VIDEO[Video meeting provider]
    API --> MAP[Map and routing provider]
    PG --> BACKUP[Backup and point-in-time recovery]
    RR -. monitored lag .-> API
    ST -. failover requires fencing .-> PG

